  speakerName: King Gug
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a090ebd2b0085d74dad8d4691898e84e, type: 3}
  dialogue:
  - You seem like a capable fighter my friend. How would you like to help out your
    king?
  - If you clear all of the slimes out of the dungeon for me, you can keep whatever
    you find down there.
  - Here, take this key. You'll need a second one to open the door though. No idea
    where I left it.
  - The door is just to your right.
